          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "master_at_arms",
            text: _("Woods, woods, woods and more woods! Bah, that general had better have a good reason for dragging me out to Halstead with all these oafs."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("But cap’n, we’re your loyal troops..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "master_at_arms",
            text: _("Shut it and keep moving."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_54",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 10,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 6,
            y: 3,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:lift_fog",
            side: "1,2",
            cells: "6,3",
            radius: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Archarel",
            text: _("Several platoons of troops were supposed to arrive today. I wonder if something happened to them."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_55",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 18,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 6,
            y: 3,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:lift_fog",
            side: "1,2",
            cells: "6,3",
            radius: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Archarel",
            text: _("Something about these woods seems quite unnatural. Perhaps we should stop sending our soldiers this way."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_56",
        on: "time_over",
        once: true,
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_57",
        on: "die",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "have_unit",
                side: 3,
              },
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_condition_tree",
                tree: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22and%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22variable%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22turn_number%22%2C%22greater_than%22%3A%2220%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "win_event",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_59",
        on: "branch_if_59",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "losses",
            equals: "false",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_achievement",
            id: "liberty_hunter",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_58",
        on: "win_event",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_59",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("It be done. Their patrols be shattered and broken."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Helicrom",
            text: _("Well done, but the fight is far from over. We will not be able to employ these tactics when more platoons arrive. You must make your choice. Will you fight? Or will you return to your village and beg for amnesty?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("Amnesty? Knowing these Wesnothians, they’ll have my head. Then again, if I could gives my life to save my whole village, I would."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("We need you! Uncle..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("I know what you is going to say, Harper. That we should be fighting for our homes, just like we do against them orcs. But we be risking everything on this, lass."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("If we go back like this, that means we’ll surrender to them Wesnothians and live our whole lives in oppression. You saw how they were sending so many soldiers and even orcs against us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Helicrom",
            text: _("The girl is naive, but her spirit is in the right place. You risk your homes and the lives of your people, yes, but what good will they be if you live in tyranny? Believe me, I have been there. I would rather die than go back."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("Yes... Erwen would’ve said the same. If we march on Halstead, we gots to burn it to the ground before the Queen’s forces rally. If we does that, Weldyn won’t have no foothold in Annuvin no more."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Helicrom",
            text: _("It would be months before they could reassemble their forces here. Enough time for you to secure your homes, or relocate."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("Then it be decided. We’ll attack the fort together. Luck be with us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:modify_unit",
            side: 2,
